  m_text: "Jos\xE9 Rizal was born on <b>June 19, 1861</b>, in Calamba, Laguna. His
    mother, <b>Teodora Alonso Realonda</b>, was one of his first teachers. She taught
    him how to read and pray at a young age.\n\nRizal later continued his education
    in Bi\xF1an, where <b>Maestro Justiniano Aquino Cruz</b> became his first formal
    school teacher."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
